<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-authn – Libraries</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/libraries/</link><description>Recent content in Libraries on go-authn</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>ko</language><atom:link href="https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/tags/libraries/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>sdcreds — systemd 없이 쓰는 systemd 자격 증명</title><link>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/sdcreds/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-authn.github.io/docs/0.11/ko/libraries/sdcreds/</guid><description>
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;systemd 유닛이 &lt;code&gt;LoadCredentialEncrypted=&lt;/code&gt;로 받는 자격 증명이 서비스에 필요한데
systemd가 없다면?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;code&gt;sdcreds&lt;/code&gt;는&lt;a href="https://systemd.io/CREDENTIALS/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;systemd 자격 증명&lt;/a&gt; 형식(&lt;code&gt;systemd-creds encrypt&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;decrypt&lt;/code&gt;)을 Go에서 읽고 쓰며, 명령줄과 s6가 감독하는
서비스에 동일한 &lt;code&gt;$CREDENTIALS_DIRECTORY&lt;/code&gt;를 제공하는 도우미를 갖추고 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;지원하는 키는 &lt;strong&gt;null&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;host&lt;/strong&gt;(&lt;code&gt;/var/lib/systemd/credential.secret&lt;/code&gt;),&lt;strong&gt;host-scoped&lt;/strong&gt;(&lt;code&gt;--uid&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;--user&lt;/code&gt;)입니다. TPM2 및 공개 키 자격 증명은 인식된 뒤&lt;code&gt;*UnsupportedModeError&lt;/code&gt;로 거부되며, 추측하는 일은 없습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="install"&gt;설치&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="install"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#install" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 고유 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;go install github.com/go-authn/sdcreds/cmd/sdcreds@latest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
